@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>At <i>Chirp!</i>, we value your privacy. We only store the information you directly 
give to us, such as your name and email when registering, and the information used to authorise your account 
with third-parties, such as GitHub. 
<br><i>Chirp!</i> does not take any responsibility of personal information
posted as a cheep in the application by the user. 
<br>
<i>Chirp!</i> does not store the information of deleted users, in compliance with the EU’s General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).
</p>
